      "field": "description",
      "before": "<p>A matching co-ord set for girls from Eminent, with a top and bottom that make dressing quick and easy.</p>\n<p>The soft knit feels comfy all day, and both pieces match for a neat, put-together look. She can wear it for outings, travel or relaxing at home.</p>\n<p>Mix the pieces with other clothes for even more outfit ideas.</p>\n<p>Good for outings, travel, weekends and home wear.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Matching top and bottom<br>\n</li>\n<li>Soft, comfy knit<br>\n</li>\n<li>Neat, put-together look<br>\n</li>\n<li>Mix and match pieces<br>\n</li>\n<li>Great for travel</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Sku:</strong> A248705</p>",
      "after": "<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Sports days and outdoor games call for this stretchy Eminent girls knitted t-shirt.<br><br>The knit flexes as she runs, jumps and plays, and it comes out of the wash in good shape. Wear it with track pants for a sporty outfit.<br><br>Made to move with her. A favourite for PE days.<br><br>Suits sports days, outdoor games, PE and playtime.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Sporty girls tee<br></span></li>\n<li><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Stretches as she plays<br></span></li>\n<li><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Shape survives the wash<br></span></li>\n<li><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Pairs with joggers<br></span></li>\n<li><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Good for PE</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Sku:</strong> A248705</p>"
